UML:Attribute.comment:
Allocate data area. data area allcation depends on its frame size (and
its structure), so this function must be virtual and defind in subclass.
@param frame This MalibFrame object.
@param A MalibHolder which has frame pointer array to allocate image data memory.

Free data area. freeing data area depends on its frame structure,
so this function must be virtual and defind in subclass.
@param frame This MalibFrame object.
@param A MalibHolder which has frame pointer array to allocate image data memory.

UML:Association.comment:
Frame access function getting a frame directly addressed
by argument that shows some offset from current frame.
@param buffer An instance of any subclass of MalibBuffer.
@param offset some offset number from current frame (or 
              it may be used an offset from start/end point).
@return Target frame.

Frame access function getting the curernt frame.
@param buffer An instance of any subclass of MalibBuffer.
@return Target frame.

Frame access function getting the next frame.
@param buffer An instance of any subclass of MalibBuffer.
@return Target frame.

Frame access function getting the previous frame.
@param buffer An instance of any subclass of MalibBuffer.
@return Target frame.
